CORE
a.c
b.c --change-impact
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
\*\* helper \*\*
^-.*function helper
^\+.*function helper
^D.*function helper
--
^warning: ignoring
//
// --change-impact reports both forward and backward impact. Beyond the
// function header, assert the syntactic-diff markers (-/+) and the
// data-dependence marker (D) so the test fails if the dependence analysis
// stops producing output.
